WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.402 line:0%
Skateboarding was my salvation
and my way of having fun.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.170
JAY DUPLASS:
<i> This film is really about Tony</i>

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.407
<i> and what's really going on
 inside of him.</i>

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.175 line:0%
He had to reinvent skating.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.043 line:0%
Make some noise for Tony Hawk!

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:12.678
(CROWD CHEERS)

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.381 line:0%
I've been trying to make
this film for a long time.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.319 line:0%
Sam pitches this idea of doing
the epic Tony Hawk documentary.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.954
<i> We both said,
 "Yes, this is amazing."</i>

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.356
And then we're off and running.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:25.024
It's a much deeper story,

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:27.226
and stuff that I've never
really shared at all.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.929
There is some footage in here
I had no idea existed.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.297
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.799
He is a beast who is just
gonna skate no matter what.

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:36.269 line:0%
Tony Hawk is the reason
I started skateboarding.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.637 line:0%
Tony Hawk is just a legend.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.241 line:0%
It takes a lot of dedication
to do what he does,
and it's really inspiring.

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:44.844
Family is hugely important
to Tony.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.213 line:0%
It was beautiful to put
that part of his life into film,

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.115
<i> and not just make it
 about skating.</i>

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.950
I feel like if I'm able
to stand on my own two feet,

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:51.951
I'm gonna ride a skateboard.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.420
<i> I'm not gonna quit doing it.</i>

